         "note": "pencil. Region 1 holds the group 8524 alone, no separators and no name; region 2 carries the roll's number 441 on its own. Read as 8.5.24. The group runs to four figures here where the comparable rolls in this batch have five (ty610zx2946 28622, fr853pn6519 22324, gb034mq5877 11822), which fits a one-figure day and tells against these groups being serial numbers."
